    {
      "sample_index": 1,
      "text": "Since when $n$ is divided by 6, the remainder is 1, we know that: $n = 6a + 1$, where $a$ is an integer.\n\nTherefore, $n + 2010 = (6a + 1) + 2010 = 6a + 2011$.\n\nNow, when $6a + 2011$ is divided by 6, the remainder is $2011$.\n\nThus, the remainder when $n + 2010$ is divided by 6 is $\\boxed{1}$.",
